# Private evidence registry — digests pinned by public records whose bytes are private.
#
# Owner: scripts/evidence_archive.py (see its docstring and M-41 in
# docs/methodology/lessons/methodology_lessons.md). The tracked *SHA256SUMS and
# *MANIFEST.sha256 files are read too; register here only pins those miss.
#
# Rule: a commit that pins a private file's SHA-256 in a public record adds its
# line here in the same commit, and the file is archived with
#   python scripts/evidence_archive.py put <file>
# then pushed to first-passage-archive. `make audit` reports each digest as
# ARCHIVED, UNPUSHED or MISSING.
#
# Format: `<sha256>  <name>` — the name is repo-root relative when the file lives
# in this checkout's private roots, otherwise where the record says it lived.
#
